Title: FlareUI quest tracker layout constants reachable (for FlareQuestie's compact mode)
Why: the tracker's spacing (header height, padding, gaps between quests and lines) is a local table, so it can't be made tighter from outside. This exposes it as OT.Constants; FlareQuestie shrinks it at load, before the tracker builds its frames. Without FlareQuestie nothing changes.

=== FILE FlareUI\Modules\ObjectiveTracker.lua
--- OLD
-- Shared with the settings specimen so its palette follows the live tracker.
--- NEW
-- LOCAL FIX: the layout constants, for FlareQuestie's compact spacing (read on every render)
OT.Constants = C

-- Shared with the settings specimen so its palette follows the live tracker.
=== END
